WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.965
They knew.

00:00:00.965 --> 00:00:02.011
They did nothing.

00:00:02.011 --> 00:00:09.011
For more than thirty years, CSIS warned successive Canadian governments about foreign interference operations on Canadian soil.

00:00:09.011 --> 00:00:10.659
Every warning was ignored.

00:00:10.659 --> 00:00:12.306
June 2024.

00:00:12.306 --> 00:00:21.818
The National Security and Intelligence Committee of Parliamentarians published a finding that witting parliamentarians — members who knowingly participated — aided foreign states.

00:00:21.818 --> 00:00:23.409
The names were redacted.

00:00:23.409 --> 00:00:26.659
The public was told to trust the system that allowed it to happen.

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:32.738
Two federal elections — 2019 and 2021 — had confirmed foreign interference.

00:00:32.738 --> 00:00:37.659
The Hogue Commission found interference may have affected results in a small number of ridings.

00:00:37.659 --> 00:00:38.784
Small number.

00:00:38.784 --> 00:00:39.806
Their words.

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:44.465
The People's Republic of China operated at least three police stations inside Canada.

00:00:44.465 --> 00:00:46.999
In Toronto's Greater Toronto Area.

00:00:46.999 --> 00:00:48.568
On Canadian soil.

00:00:48.568 --> 00:00:52.079
Safeguard Defenders documented over one hundred globally.

00:00:52.079 --> 00:00:53.715
Canada found three.

00:00:53.715 --> 00:00:54.806
At minimum.

00:00:54.806 --> 00:00:56.363
The Han Dong case.

00:00:56.363 --> 00:01:02.636
PRC operatives allegedly bussed international students to a 2019 Liberal nomination vote.

00:01:02.636 --> 00:01:04.556
Han Dong won the nomination.

00:01:04.556 --> 00:01:06.238
He was elected to Parliament.

00:01:06.238 --> 00:01:10.136
He resigned from the Liberal caucus only after the story became public.

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:12.136
September 2023.

00:01:12.136 --> 00:01:18.034
Hardeep Singh Nijjar was assassinated on Canadian soil at a Sikh temple in Surrey, British Columbia.

00:01:18.034 --> 00:01:21.647
The RCMP confirmed Indian government agents were responsible.

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:22.931
An assassination.

00:01:22.931 --> 00:01:24.454
On Canadian soil.

00:01:24.454 --> 00:01:25.806
By a foreign government.

00:01:25.806 --> 00:01:31.636
Bill C-70 — the Countering Foreign Interference Act — finally passed in 2024.

00:01:31.636 --> 00:01:33.681
After thirty years of warnings.

00:01:33.681 --> 00:01:35.931
After two compromised elections.

00:01:35.931 --> 00:01:37.511
After an assassination.

00:01:37.511 --> 00:01:41.931
The generation that stormed Juno Beach would not recognize what we have become.
